{"id":685,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Slurpuff’s fur contains a lot of air, making it soft to the touch and lighter than it looks."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"By taking in a person’s scent, it can sniff out their mental and physical condition. It’s hoped that this skill will have many medical applications."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"Its sense of smell is 100 million times better than a human’s, so even the faintest scent tells it about everything in the area. It’s like it can see with its nose!"},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"It can distinguish the faintest of scents. It puts its sensitive sense of smell to use by helping pastry chefs in their work."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Sweet Veil","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents the Pokémon and its allies from falling asleep."},{"name":"Unburden","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Speed stat if the Pokémon's held item is used or lost."}],"eggGroups":["Fairy"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"White","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":684,"name":"Swirlix","condition":null,"children":[{"id":685,"name":"Slurpuff","condition":"Trade, holding Whipped Dream","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,33],[1,230],[1,584],[1,589],[9,312],[12,577],[15,313],[18,496],[21,81],[24,178],[27,412],[30,273],[33,583],[36,538],[39,283],[42,564]],"machine":[133,213,347,204,605,409,577,203,412,263,313,53,416,270,63,113,118,583,182,94,240,156,496,219,214,173,164,241,57,168,87,85],"egg":[],"tutor":[802]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-236","name":"Slurpuff","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"236","artist":"Yoshimoto Yoshimon","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-236/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-236/large"},{"id":"me2pt5-94","name":"Slurpuff","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"94","artist":"Natsumi Yoshid